eChanged" ToolTip="To date (inclusive)" AutomationProperties.Name="To date"/></WrapPanel><CheckBox x:Name="ExactFilter" Content="Exact words" Checked="ExactChanged" Unchecked="ExactChanged" Margin="0,0,8,6"/></WrapPanel></StackPanel>
